// Copy this file to Signing.local.xcconfig (gitignored) and fill in the
// team from your Apple Developer account. project.yml applies the copy to
// every configuration of both targets. Signing is automatic, so no identity or
// profile is named here: Xcode uses the team's Apple Development
// certificate, creates the iPhone team profile on demand when xcodebuild
// runs with -allowProvisioningUpdates, and needs no profile for the Mac
// Catalyst build because the entitlements are empty. A SETTING=value on
// the xcodebuild command line still overrides this file.

// Team ID from https://developer.apple.com/account → Membership.
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = YOURTEAMID
